<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND SIGNS PLN 1.8 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND SIGNS PLN 1.8 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish computer software firm Computerland SA signed a 1.8-million-zloty contract with the Warsaw branch of Polish telecommunications monopoly Telekomunikacja Polska SA, Computerland said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the contract was for the building of a local area network (LAN) computer network.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
